        "id": 1527433
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-05T19:57:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for your feedback! I followed Diana\u0027s suggestion. Instead of a 3-state FSM with a `DPM_PD_BUTTON_RELEASED` state to process the button press and return to the idle state, this is now a 2-state FSM where the power button pressed is handled in the `DPM_PD_BUTTON_PRESSED` state before returning to idle. Instead of looking at the remaining time on a timer to determine short/long press, this will log the time when a button press is received and compare it to the time at release.",
      "parentUuid": "0d721f63_22648a47",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 575,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 579,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "31178b403129f28c84e3c59adfbefe4f1ebaa5b1",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
